message: "If you use this code, please cite it and the article arXiv:2611.33284."
title: "Code for: Structure-factor witnesses of thermal entanglement: exact optimal covariance criteria for the XY chain"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/julia-mathe/xy-chain-entanglement-witnesses"
abstract: "MATLAB code that reproduces the numerical results and figures of the article: optimal covariance-matrix entanglement witnesses for the thermal XY chain, structure factors, small-chain benchmarks, quench dynamics and bounds on entanglement measures."
keywords:
